<isscript>
/*
    This file is a collection of styles for email templates.  When you call the printStyles function from the isml file, that function takes the key/value pairs and prints them as a 
    string into the "style" attr of the DOM element.  
    
    If you want to go Math or Logic to the key/value pair make sure to have the value as a number, not a string. 
        **Example of string
            'width': '100px'
        **Example of number
            'width': 100
            
    If value is a string and needs to be in pixels, em's, % then include the unit in the string.  The exception to this is if you will be doing math on this later.
*/

